rom f7\n- **Q: e8-g6** gives check and directly attacks the king\n\nReason: Q: e8-d7 is the strongest move. It delivers check to the exposed Black king on e6, forcing it to move. The queen on d7 will be superbly centralized, controlling critical squares and maintaining maximum pressure on Black's position. With Black's king so exposed and my material advantage, this check will either lead to winning more material or force the king into an even worse position, bringing me closer to checkmate.\n\nAnswer: Q: e8-d7"}
