 my position\n- After the king moves, I can activate other pieces\n\nReason: N: b1-c3 gives check to the Black king on b4, forcing it to retreat while developing my knight with tempo. This is the most forcing move that improves my position immediately. After the king moves, I'll have better coordination and can activate my rook or push central pawns.\n\nAnswer: N: b1-c3"}
