: c7-b5 delivers check while simultaneously attacking the bishop on c5. This is a classic knight fork - the black king must move to escape check, and then I can capture the bishop on the next move with Nxc5. This wins significant material (a bishop) and should lead to an easy victory with my material advantage.\n\nAnswer: N: c7-b5"}
