ame where White has overwhelming material advantage (Rook + Bishop + 3 Pawns vs 1 Pawn)\n- Black's king cannot recapture as it would move away from defending the f4 pawn\n- This leads to a straightforward winning plan of advancing pawns with piece support\n\nAnswer: R: b2-b6"}
