ng on c8 (very far away), I need to create threats quickly before the Rook can dominate. The h-pawn can advance with tempo, and even though Black's Rook will eventually stop it, this creates the most practical complications and forces Black to calculate accurately.\n\nAnswer: P: h2-h4"}
